      "text": "Saints should act upon land as for years, D&C 51:17. the Lord to retain strong hold in Kirtland for five years, D&C 64:21. the 7,000 years of earth’s temporal existence, D&C 77:6, 8–12 (88:108–9). priesthood is without beginning of days or end of years, D&C 84:17. planets give light to each other in their times and years, D&C 88:44. elders to proclaim acceptable year of the Lord, D&C 93:51. appointed days, months, and years of heavenly bodies will be revealed, D&C 121:31. year of redeemed is come, D&C 133:52.",
